{"id":"ctabtn01","elType":"widget","settings":{"text":"Start a conversation","link":{"url":"mailto:info@andrewbaeten.nl","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"text_color":"#111111","background_color":"#F9C221","button_background_hover_color":"#FFFFFF","hover_color":"#111111","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"8","right":"8","bottom":"8","left":"8","isLinked":true},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":15,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"button"}],"isInner":false}],"document_type":"single-post","edit_mode":"builder","template_type":"single-post","page_settings":[],"conditions":[],"elementor_version":"4.2.4"},"fingerprint":"e11cd92340ff06ad422b831de71d6c70e435b0500f0fcfecd53c8c4eb7f6d829"}},{"action":"post.get","result":{"post":{"id":4626,"type":"elementor_library","status":"draft","title":"Recruiter Case Study - Static Prototype","slug":"recruiter-case-study-static-prototype","content":"<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700\">Selected case \u00b7 WordPress \/ WooCommerce<\/p>\t\t\t<h1>Byderma \u2014 structuring treatments, booking and ecommerce in one WordPress platform<\/h1>\t\t<p>Byderma combines multiple beauty treatments, appointment booking, a large WooCommerce catalogue and member benefits. I structured the WordPress and WooCommerce experience so each journey stays clear while the platform still feels consistent across desktop and mobile.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/byderma.nl\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVisit live Byderma site\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/cases\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tView all cases\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1536\" height=\"1152\" src=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1536x1152.png\" alt=\"Byderma webshop homepage shown on desktop\" srcset=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1536x1152.png 1536w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-768x576.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700\">Role<\/p>\t\t\tWordPress Developer\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700\">Platform<\/p>\t\t\tWordPress + WooCommerce\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700\">Focus<\/p>\t\t\tUX \u00b7 Ecommerce \u00b7 Responsive\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-weight:700\">Journeys<\/p>\t\t\tTreatments \u00b7 Shop \u00b7 Booking\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700\">01 \u00b7 The challenge<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>Three core journeys, one coherent beauty platform<\/h2>\t\t<p>The business combines treatment discovery, appointment booking and ecommerce, with member content supporting those journeys. The challenge was to keep those needs from competing for attention while the experience still feels like one Byderma platform.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Treatment discovery<\/h3>\t\t<p>Multiple treatment categories need enough context to help visitors choose and then move naturally toward booking.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Booking handoff<\/h3>\t\t<p>Treatment information needs a clear route into appointment booking without turning every service page into a commerce flow.<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Commerce &amp; member support<\/h3>\t\t<p>The WooCommerce catalogue stays product-focused, while member and account content remains accessible without interrupting the primary journeys.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700\">02 \u00b7 My contribution<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>I translated that business complexity into a clear WordPress information architecture<\/h2>\t\t<p>My role was WordPress developer. I structured how treatments, booking, WooCommerce and supporting member content relate to each other, then carried the same hierarchy through to smaller screens.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700\">01<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Information architecture<\/h3>\t\t<p>I separated treatment discovery, shopping and booking into distinct paths so users can immediately understand what kind of task they are in.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700\">02<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>WooCommerce journey<\/h3>\t\t<p>I kept product discovery and purchasing focused inside the shop, while treatment information hands off naturally to appointments.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700\">03<\/p>\t\t\t<h3>Responsive hierarchy<\/h3>\t\t<p>I preserved the same task priority on mobile instead of collapsing different intents into one generic flow.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700\">03 \u00b7 Engineering decisions<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>WordPress decisions behind a mixed service-and-commerce platform<\/h2>\t\t<p>The value of this case is not just the finished interface; it is how the platform is organised. WordPress and WooCommerce support different user intents without forcing treatment discovery, booking and ecommerce into one generic flow.<\/p><p><strong style=\"color:#F9C221\">Verified stack<\/strong><br>WordPress \u00b7 WooCommerce<\/p><p><strong style=\"color:#F9C221\">Architecture<\/strong><br>Treatment discovery \u00b7 appointment routes \u00b7 product discovery \u00b7 member\/account support<\/p><p><strong style=\"color:#F9C221\">Responsive principle<\/strong><br>Preserve the same hierarchy and task separation on smaller screens<\/p><p><strong style=\"color:#F9C221\">Evidence<\/strong><br>Live Byderma site \u00b7 verified project media across desktop, tablet and mobile<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700\">04 \u00b7 Live proof<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>The structure is visible in the live product and responsive project captures<\/h2>\t\t<p>Byderma.nl currently exposes the same core model: treatment categories, appointment booking, a product boutique and member benefits. The verified project media below shows the interface across desktop, tablet and mobile.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1024x768.png\" alt=\"Byderma webshop homepage shown on desktop\" srcset=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-macbook-pro-mockup-10-3-1536x1152.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDesktop homepage\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-1024x768.png\" alt=\"Byderma webshop responsive layout shown on tablet\" srcset=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-1536x1152.png 1536w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/minimalistic-ipad-mockup-9-2-2048x1536.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTablet layout\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-1024x768.png\" alt=\"Byderma webshop mobile layout shown on a phone\" srcset=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-1536x1152.png 1536w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-14-pro-mockup-9-3-2048x1536.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMobile layout\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-1024x768.png\" alt=\"Byderma webshop key page flow shown on mobile\" srcset=\"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-1024x768.png 1024w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-300x225.png 300w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-768x576.png 768w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-1536x1152.png 1536w, https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/iphone-15-mockup-minimalistic-design-9-3-2048x1536.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMobile conversion flow\t\t<p><strong style=\"color:#F9C221\">Outcome<\/strong><br>The live platform keeps treatment discovery, booking, ecommerce and member support recognisable as separate tasks inside one brand experience.<\/p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:700\">Open to WordPress opportunities<\/p>\t\t\t<h2>Looking for a WordPress developer who can make complex journeys feel simple?<\/h2>\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center\">This case shows how I translate mixed service and ecommerce requirements into a clear WordPress and WooCommerce experience, with decisions that remain understandable across desktop and mobile.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@andrewbaeten.nl\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStart a conversation\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>","excerpt":"","author":1,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"date":"2026-09-06 22:17:23","date_gmt":"0000-00-00 00:00:00","modified":"2026-09-06 22:17:23","modified_gmt":"2026-09-06 22:17:23","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","password_protected":"[redacted]","featured_media":0,"permalink":"https:\/\/andrewbaeten.nl\/?post_type=elementor_library&p=4626"},"fingerprint":"5d2b413d3b150c8e43158551e1e71202e0cb685b31c74d7a420eb6ec22d1471b"}}]},"meta":{"request_fingerprint":"26e779cc4db4d8ec73790f38806ea4eb22f37cc82e3c14f2763fb24786acede0"}}